-#### Why This Works
+Why this works:
 - The data is already public (forums, FCC filings, teardowns) but unstructured
 - The community already exists (right-to-repair, OSS) but unfunded
 - The demand is proven (people already paying for jailbreaks, custom firmware)
 - The legal landscape is shifting in favor of repair (EU, US state-level RTR laws)
 
